  "source_change_scope": {
    "unique_scientific_formula_change": "The four original boundary layers use the fixed R725 C3 three-piece cutoff at epsilon=1/8; paired central halfwaves, bubble/lift S5, full variables and original normal/optimization algorithms are retained.",
    "seed_plan": "The source inserts both exact interior cuts in each of four boundary layers before complete original positive Gauss evaluation. It records all new boundary pieces. The separate outer base whole-cell Gauss and partial-Lagrange rules remain byte-identical.",
