    "pure_seed_metadata": "All 8,012 bytes of the original supported_seed_metadata function are preserved in one complete new source_binding function except the actual new plan schema, explicit R725 plan fields and two additional output fields. The main reader delegates by actual whole-file SHA and method-source identity.",
    "cache": "Both new actual normal and meridian-helper sources are pinned in the whole selector; geometry pins that selector, and the pure cache binder pins selector and geometry names, SHA256, byte sizes and schema.",
    "transfer": "Complete parent families, input/protection/history/13-member methods remain. Definition flags no longer claim the R725 physical seed change is only a cache policy or that old plain-seed finals satisfy a new exact seed model. Exact full-model checks are not weakened.",
